      "value": "Sure, why not. But I'm only agreeing so that it's friends only. If it's made public people would spam Oathmeal, Zentraya, Nagzz21, and any other popular Youtuber & Twitch streamer.... Friends only, yeah. \n\nAlso agree with having it set so you can't receive messages either.",
